course: dictionary
lesson: 15510
title: One word, many meanings
level: primary-5
stars: 1
explain: Some words have more than one meaning, and the sentence tells you which one you need. «Submit» is one of them. To submit homework is to hand it in so a teacher can check it.
explain: Read the words around it. «She submitted her story to the school competition» means she sent it in to be judged. «The soldiers had to submit to the enemy» means they gave in and obeyed. Same word, different meaning.
explain: Try your meaning in the sentence. Ask: is this about handing in work, giving in, or pressing a button? The clues around the word will tell you which meaning fits.
fact: «Submit» means to hand in or send something so it can be checked or judged.
fact: «Submit» can also mean to give in and accept someone's power or control.
fact: «Submit» can mean to state an opinion politely, as in «I submit that the plan is unfair.»
fact: On a computer, «Submit» means to click a button that sends what you typed.
fact: Useful phrases: submit homework, submit to someone, submit an application.
exercise: «Mia will submit her project on Friday.» What does submit mean here? | Click a button to type | *Hand it in so it can be checked | Give in and obey | Whisper softly
exercise: «The knight had to submit to the king.» What does submit mean here? | *Give in and accept the king's power | Shout loudly at the king | Politely state an opinion | Hand in a homework book
exercise: «Press Submit to send your form.» What does Submit mean here? | Read the form aloud | Hide the form | *Click a button to send what you typed | Draw a picture on the form
test: «I submit that the plan is unfair.» In this sentence, what does submit mean? | Give in and obey | *Politely state an opinion | Hand it in | Send a parcel by post
test: Which phrase means to send in a form to apply for a job? | Submit a wave | *Submit an application | Submit a song | Submit to the rain
exam: Which sentence uses submit to mean give in and obey? | The computer will submit slowly | Jack will submit his old shoes to the shop | The class will submit their poems on Monday | *The rebels finally submit to the new rules
